/-!
# S4-EtPBC-A, R4-T2 (A3p): the residue `θh` of a descended presentation from a chart `E` (generic)

* `presCongr h : Pres g₁ ≃ₐ[P] Pres g₂` for `h : g₁ = g₂` (`presCongr_mk`);
