For `π : Y ⟶ P¹_V` (`V` affine):
* `isAffineOpen_Qc`, `isAffineOpen_Yc`: the charts `Qᵢ` of `P¹_V` and `Yᵢ = π⁻¹ Qᵢ` are affine;
